 "drawing": "Single-door showcase cabinet (glass-panel upper door over solid lower door), full-height sides 2040. No dimension lines. Sides 2,3 (2040x426) stand on bottom 4 (630x450, Direkta 7x70); top 1 (630x450) fixed on the sides (eccentrics). Carcass width = fixed shelf 568 + 2x16 = 600 (backs 596), so top and bottom 630 overhang the sides by ~15 mm each side and are 450 deep vs 426 sides. Fixed shelf 5 (568x426) at the door split, ~700 above the bottom (lower door 700); upper compartment: 2 glass shelves 7 (566x416) + LED 2 clips; lower compartment: 2 removable ЛДСП shelves 6 (564x416). Doors 13 upper 1334 high x 564 wide (glazed frame per elevation), 14 lower 700 x 564; 1334+700 = 2034 vs 2040 side. Hinges inset 5 = 3 upper + 2 lower; handles 2; door side (L/R) chosen at assembly. Cornice 12 is one part 710x491 screwed onto top 1 (4x25). Plinth box 8/11 (620x70) + 9/10 (368x70) under the bottom with 4 levelling feet. Pilasters 15/16 (2040x22) on the side front edges. Backs ДВП: 17 1359x596 upper + 18 725x596 lower (1359+725 = 2084 ≈ 2040+2x16+12 overlap), scheme p2: 17 above 18. Overall height estimate (16 mm boards): 70+16+2040+16 = 2142 + cornice. front view: pages/turin-0-12-p1.png 486,291,541,475 (also larger: pages/turin-0-12-p3.png 701,7,805,351)"
